## Conclusion

PhoneGap provides an opportunity for a vast pool of web developers to reuse their existing skills to develop applications for mobile phones, which in future is going to be one of the most important mediums to access information and content on the internet. As the phones become more powerful, the new capabilities will be available in your arsenal. The recent developments in HTML5 based technologies also usher in a new change in this segment. Do not miss the bus and keep exploring PhoneGap.
